<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#07101d">
  <title>{% block title %}A股ABC{% endblock %}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/app.css">
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/echarts@5/dist/echarts.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/static/app.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <a class="brand" href="/">ABC 日线交易系统 <small>V2</small></a>
  <nav>
    <a href="/">今日操作</a>
    <a href="/screener">最近信号</a>
    <a href="/portfolio">账户回测</a>
    <a href="/review">历史复盘</a>
    <a href="/data">数据状态</a>
    <a href="/validation">策略校验</a>
    <a href="/backtest">执行研究</a>
    <a href="/logout">退出</a>
  </nav>
</header>
<main>{% block content %}{% endblock %}</main>
<footer>
  实盘原则：只按正式日线信号执行；收盘确认，下一交易日开盘执行。仓位由结构风险预算机械计算；不设人为固定止盈，卖出由策略动态规则触发。网页是执行辅助，不连接券商自动下单。
</footer>
</body>
</html>
